          %p where
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                On the left we have
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/looping+and+delooping"} looping and delooping
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} equivalences
                (
                %a{:href => "May+recognition+theorem#RecognitionForGroupsInAnInfinityTopos"}> this Prop.
                ), using that the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/based+loop+space"} based loop space
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi SU
