          %p
            On the other hand, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/colimit"} colimit
            of Ravenel’s spectra as
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi n
                  %mo →
                  %mn ∞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n \to \infty
            is
            = succeed "," do
