          %h2#references References
          %div
            %h3#ReferencesFiniteStageOrientations Finite-dimensional complex orientation and Ravenel’s spectra
            %p
              Discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+oriented+cohomology+theory"} complex orientation
              (in
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+generalized+cohomology"} Whitehead generalized cohomology
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+vector+bundles"} complex vector bundles
              which are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+bundle"} pulled back
              from base spaces of
              %em
